<title>USA: First State Bancorp Q3 net increases.</title>
<headline>First State Bancorp Q3 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(thousands except per share)</p>
<p>		    Third Quarter Ended	 Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		     September 30,		 September 30,</p>
<p>			1996	   1995	  1996	   1995</p>
<p>Interest income   $6,611	$5,379     $18,674	$15,037</p>
<p>Interest expense  $2,514	$2,066     $6,950	 $5,243</p>
<p>Net interest income before</p>
<p>provision for loan losses</p>
<p>			$4,097	$3,313     $11,724	$9,794</p>
