<p>		     $3,834	$3,206     $10,827	$9,478</p>
<p>Net income	 $617	  $586	 $1,397	 $1,773</p>
<p>Primary earnings per share(a)</p>
<p>		     $0.29	 $0.29	 $0.67	  $0.86</p>
